      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dyke%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early settlers in Dyke included the Parrott, Gibson, Austin, Shifflet, Ogg, and White families.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dyke%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Binghams United Methodist Church, once Austin's Meeting House, was founded in 1796 on the north side of the Lynch River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
